ails</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"77827898\"/></p><p><strong>4 Inch Borehole SS Submersible Pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231641187373663.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>We supply 4 Inch Borehole SS Submersible Pump. This JIADI SP series offers high efficiency, high resistance to sand and other abrasives, motor burnout protection, and easy maintenance. A complete digital control system is available to maintain constant well condition of the pumping system.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Model Number</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">4SPD5</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Outlet</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">G1.25~1.5&amp;rdquo;</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Warranty</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">1 year</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Volts</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">220-240/380-415V,</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Insulation class</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">B</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Impeller Material</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Stainless steel</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Maximum Diameter</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">98mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Length</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">561-1618mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Highest Temperature of liquid</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Phase</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Single phase/ Three phase</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Application</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Water supply systems<br/>Booster<br/>Garden and farm irrigation<br/>Lowering underground water level<br/>Constructions<br/>Various industrial applications</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231643314844511.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231641153271827.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts advantages</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Copper Motor</p><p><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231644095016187.jpg\"/></p><p>·Pure copper</p><p>·50Hz or 60Hz can be designed</p><p>·High speed and efficiency</p><p>·With food grade oil never pollute the water</p><p>·Lower temperature and longer lifespan for the motor</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Stator</p><p><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231644174279295.jpg\"/></p><p>·Cold-rolled Silicon steel (#800) with standard pieces</p><p>·Keep power durable and efficiency</p><p>·Continuous operating guaranteed</p><p><br/></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Rotor Shaft</p><p><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231644267585509.jpg\"/></p><p>·Super-high precision machine process</p><p>·Super smooth shaft surface(mirror finish), reduce energy loss and mechanical seal abrasion</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Mechanical Seal </p><p><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231644367093612.jpg\"/></p><p>·Super-high precision Carborundum Graphite mechanical seal</p><p>·No oil-leakage keep the well safe</p><p>·Water and sand proof keep the motor safe</p><p><br/></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Stud/Nut/Screws </p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231644469614274.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image019(001).jpg\"/><img alt=\"image021(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231644525148074.jpg\"/></p><p>·S/S 304, anti-rust</p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Bearing</p><p><img alt=\"image023(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231645065214971.jpg\"/></p><p>·C&amp;U brand(#7204), longer working life</p><p>·Motor runs more stable and smoothly, reduce power loss</p><p><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Packing details</strong></p><p>If the customer has no special requirement, we generally pack the products with wooden cases or cartons. </p><p>The pump and the control box are packed in one case if the total length of the cable is more than 20m. </p><p>Contrarily, the pump and the control box are respectively packed.</p><p><strong>4. Certification</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231649595619178.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image025(001).jpg\"/></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO14001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">OHSAS18001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">CE</td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231650025677204.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image027(001).jpg\"/></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\